msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Maybe we should hide this before someone gets hurt."
msgstr "어쩌면 누군가 다치기 전에 이걸 숨겨야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
