msgstr "나한테는 잔해처럼 보이는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
