msgstr "거의 너무 뜨겁다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
