#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "It's not factory standard."
msgstr "공장 표준이 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
