msgstr "저건... 돌이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK6"
