msgstr "저건... 돌이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK7"
