msgstr "저 나무가 방금 움직였나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "I coulda built something with that."
msgstr "저걸로 뭘 만들 수 있을 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a hunk of wood."
msgstr "나무 덩어리다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I could use a bit of prosperity."
msgstr "돈 좀 있으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
