msgstr "잘 했다, 녀석."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
