msgstr "%s은(는) 변하지 않았구나. 살인자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
