msgstr "%s은(는) 우리 친구구나! 하 하! 맞구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL"
