#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_gnaw
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_gnaw"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nNamed for the hunger that gnaws eternally at its belly, no one knows what the Gnaw is from whence it came."
msgstr "이 아이템을 장착하여 캐릭터의 배경 초상을 바꾼다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_grasslands
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_grasslands"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait."
msgstr "이 아이템을 착용하면 캐릭터의 배경 초상이 변경된다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_gravestones
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_gravestones"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nThe lives of many goats were claimed by the Gnaw's plague. In the end, only a few remained."
msgstr "이 아이템을 장착하여 캐릭터의 배경 초상을 변경한다.\n\n쏠개의 역병으로 많은 염소가 죽었다. 결국에는 염소가 몇 마리 남지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_graveyard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_graveyard"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nMany residents of the Gorge turned to worshipping the Gnaw, hoping to be spared from its terrible plague."
msgstr "이 아이템을 장착하여 캐릭터의 배경 초상을 변경한다.\n\n역병을 피하려는 소망으로 골짜기의 많은 거주자들이 쏠개를 숭배하기 시작했다."

