#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid"
msgid "The slings and arrows of fate have taken their toll on this poor, afflicted heart."
msgstr "운명의 새총과 화살이 불쌍하고 고통 받는 마음에 타격을 주었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.reviver_cupid_2"
msgid "Alas, some daggers through the heart are more literal than others."
msgstr "아아, 심장을 관통하는 단도가 문어적 표현이 아닐 때도 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.shovel_victorian"
msgid "A lovely shovel with decorative silver engravings."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_bee
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_bee"
msgid "It doesn't hit harder than a regular spear, although it certainly still stings."
msgstr "보통의 창보다 더 세게 찌르지는 않지만 아픈 것은 마찬가지."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose"
msgid "No sharper than any other spear, though much lovelier."
msgstr "다른 창보다 더 날카롭지는 않지만 훨씬 더 아름답다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.strawhat_floppy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.strawhat_floppy"
msgid "Be like a little British lady in your garden!"
msgstr "정원에서 작은 영국 숙녀처럼 지낸다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_derby
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_derby"
msgid "Demonstrate your impeccable style with this dapper bowler hat."
msgstr "말쑥한 중산모로 완벽한 스타일을 시연한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_festive_bell_red_firehound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.tophat_festive_bell_red_firehound"
msgid "A festive 'firehound red' colored tophat."
msgstr "축제 분위기의 '불개 빨간색' 톱해트."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_rag
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_rag"
msgid "Give your torch some visual flare with these hastily wrapped, desiccated rags. Smoky!"
msgstr "급하게 두른 건조한 헝겊으로 횃불에 화려함을 준다. 연기 듬뿍!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow"
msgid "At first glance this torch appears menacing, but holding it makes you feel quite sad."
msgstr "언뜻 보기에 위험해 보이는 횃불이지만, 들고 있으면 슬픈 느낌이 든다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_shadow_alt"
msgid "At first glance this torch appears menacing, but holding it makes you feel quite sad."
msgstr "언뜻 보기에 위험해 보이는 횃불이지만, 들고 있으면 슬픈 느낌이 든다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_spooky
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.torch_spooky"
msgid "Repel the dark these Hallowed Nights with a dreadful beacon of most Hallowed Light."
msgstr "가장 신성한 빛의 무시무시한 신호로 Hallowed 밤의 어둠을 격퇴한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_carpetbag
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_carpetbag"
msgid "This bag made from luxurious carpet is the height of modern fashion!"
msgstr "고급 카펫으로 만든 이 가방은 현대 패션의 정점이다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_gingerbread
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_gingerbread"
msgid "Don't be fooled... it's completely inedible."
msgstr "속지 마라... 전혀 먹을 수 없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_posh
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_posh"
msgid "A chest worthy of storing your finest gems and treasures. Or, y'know, twigs and manure."
msgstr "가장 멋진 보석과 보물 아니면 나뭇가지와 비료를 저장할 가치가 궤짝."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_poshprint
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_poshprint"
msgid "No Chesters were harmed in the making of this chest... I think."
msgstr "이 궤짝을 만드는 데 체스터를 해치지 않았다... 인가."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_sacred
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_sacred"
msgid "The history of an ancient people is locked away inside."
msgstr "고대인의 역사가 안에 잠겨있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_steamertrunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_steamertrunk"
msgid "NOTE: Doesn't steam."
msgstr "참고: 증기가 발생하지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traincase
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traincase"
msgid "Organize your foraged scraps in class and style."
msgstr "수집한 잡동사니를 품위와 스타일 있게 정리한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traveltrunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_traveltrunk"
msgid "Its traveling days may be over, but it'll always have the memories."
msgstr "그 여행의 나날은 끝났을지도 모르지만, 항상 추억은 남아 있을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the arena."
msgstr "위그프리드는 투기장을 위해 태어났다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_cook"
msgid "Wigfrid has many pot roasts in her future."
msgstr "위그프리드는 미래에 많은 폿 로스트를 먹을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops"
msgid "Deerfrid Costume"
msgstr "디어프리드 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d"
msgid "Wigfrid chose to be one of her favorite foes to battle for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "위그프리드는 신성한 밤을 위해 좋아하는 적이 되기로 했다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formal"
msgid "She resembles a Visigothic princess."
msgstr "서고트족 공주처럼 보인다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "The question was never IF Wigfrid would master the ring, but when."
msgstr "핵심은 위그프리드가 언제 링을 정복하느냐였다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_nature"
msgid "Wigfrid would fight to her last breath to protect the spirit of the forest."
msgstr "위그프리드는 숲의 정령을 보호하기 위해 그녀의 마지막 숨이 다할 때까지 싸울 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the part of Red Queen."
msgstr "위그프리드는 붉은 여왕 역할을 맡기 위해 태어났다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow"
msgid "Go to the dark side and be on top of the world."
msgstr "어둠의 편이 되어 세계를 정복한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor"
msgid "A warrior cannot eat until she defeats some meat."
msgstr "전사는 고기를 무찌르지 않으면 먹을 수 없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_victorian"
msgid "It seems Ms. Wigfrid can connect to the poetry of any tragedy."
msgstr "위그프리드는 모든 비극적인 시에 공감할 수 있는 것으로 보인다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant"
msgid "Maxwell believes this look to be quite intimidating."
msgstr "맥스웰은 이 모습이 매우 위협적이라고 생각한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_cook"
msgid "Maxwell is ready to roll up his sleeves and get cooking."
msgstr "맥스웰은 소매를 걷어붙이고 요리할 준비가 되었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal"
msgid "Against all possible odds Maxwell has become even more dapper."
msgstr "불가능한 줄 알았지만 맥스웰은 더 말쑥해졌다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "Maxwell is both dark AND brooding."
msgstr "맥스웰은 어둡고 우울하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus"
msgid "Krampwell Costume"
msgstr "크램프웰 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d"
msgid "Maxwell deeply regrets asking the others to choose his costume for him."
msgstr "맥스웰은 자기 의상을 남에게 맡긴 것을 깊게 후회한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_nature"
msgid "Maxwell is capable of tapping into many magical energies, including those of the natural world."
msgstr "맥스웰은 자연 세계를 포함하여 많은 마법 에너지를 활용할 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen, a round of applause for our lovely assistant."
msgstr "신사 숙녀 여러분, 아름다운 조수에게 박수를."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor"
msgid "This is Maxwell, the intrepid explorer."
msgstr "대담한 탐험가, 맥스웰."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow"
msgid "Before it all went so wrong..."
msgstr "모든 것이 다 틀어지기 전..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_victorian"
msgid "Money and affluence have gone straight to this gentleman's head."
msgstr "돈과 부유함이 이 신사의 판단력에 영향을 주었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat"
msgid "Webilisk Costume"
msgstr "웨비리스크 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d"
msgid "Gosh, those wings look very... real."
msgstr "음, 날개가 매우... 진짜 같다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant"
msgid "Webber's used to fending for himself."
msgstr "웨버는 자신을 지키는 것에 익숙하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_cook"
msgid "Webber loves helping out in the kitchen."
msgstr "웨버는 부엌에서 도와주는 것을 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formal"
msgid "Webber takes parties seriously."
msgstr "웨버는 진지하게 파티를 즐긴다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator"
msgid "It's not wise to corner venomous spiders."
msgstr "독거미를 위협하는 것은 현명하지 않다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_ice"
msgid "Webber never needs to buy a winter coat. He makes his own."
msgstr "웨버는 겨울 코트를 구입할 필요가 없다. 스스로 만드니까."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose"
msgid "The rosebuds are tangled in there real good."
msgstr "장미꽃 봉오리가 제대로 얽혀 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow"
msgid "Dark spiders have poisonous fangs."
msgstr "어두운 거미는 독 엄니를 가지고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor"
msgid "Webber looks a little worse for the wear."
msgstr "웨버가 지쳐 보인다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_victorian"
msgid "This lively young lad has a most healthy pallor."
msgstr "이 청년은 건강한 창백함을 가지고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant"
msgid "If Wendy is to succumb to death, she'll do so on her own terms."
msgstr "웬디가 죽음에 굴복한다면, 그녀는 자신의 조건에 따라 죽을 것입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_cook"
msgid "Wendy's not had much kitchen experience, but she's willing to learn."
msgstr "웬디는 주방에서의 경험이 적지만 배울 의향이 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formal"
msgid "Wendy is not cheered by party games."
msgstr "웬디는 파티 게임이 즐겁지 않다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator"
msgid "Wendy's hidden ruthlessness needed only slight provocation to show itself."
msgstr "약간의 도발만으로 웬디의 숨겨진 무자비함이 드러났다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ice"
msgid "Wendy feels cold and ephemeral as season's first fallen snowflake."
msgstr "웬디는 처음 내린 눈송이처럼 차갑고 덧없게 느껴진다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant"
msgid "Wendyflower Costume"
msgstr "웬디플라워 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d"
msgid "Wendy quite fancies this hair color."
msgstr "웬디는 이 머리카락 색을 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose"
msgid "A dark crimson rose represents mourning."
msgstr "어두운 진홍색 장미는 애도를 나타낸다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow"
msgid "Wendy has always been comfortable with darkness."
msgstr "웬디는 예전부터 어둠에 익숙했다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor"
msgid "Wendy is actually pretty good at surviving."
msgstr "웬디는 실제로 생존력이 뛰어나다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_victorian"
msgid "Wendy is the queen of socially mandated mourning practices."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant"
msgid "Wes is quiet, but not meek."
msgstr "웨스는 조용하지만 약하지 않다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_cook"
msgid "Wes knows a meal's good when the whole table eats in silence."
msgstr "웨스는 모든 사람이 침묵에서 먹을 때 좋은 식사라는 것을 안다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formal"
msgid "Formal Wes requires extra pomade."
msgstr "정장 웨스는 머릿기름이 더 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator"
msgid "Beware the battle mime."
msgstr "전투 마임을 조심하시오."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake"
msgid "Wesdrake Costume"
msgstr "웨스드레이크 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d"
msgid "What's the sound of one mandrake meeping?"
msgstr "맨드레이크 하나가 우는 소리는 무엇인가?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_nature"
msgid "Wes is an avid landscape painter in his downtime."
msgstr "웨스는 열렬한 조경가로 여가를 보낸다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose"
msgid "Wes always felt his rosy cheeks were his best feature."
msgstr "웨스는 항상 그의 장밋빛 뺨이 가장 뛰어난 특징이라고 생각했다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow"
msgid "The sun is too bright. It blots out the darkness."
msgstr "태양이 너무 밝다. 해가 어둠을 없앤다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor"
msgid "Even mimes can fight if confronted with a monster."
msgstr "괴물 앞에 서면 마임도 싸울 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_victorian"
msgid "This sweep's work is quite grueling. He'd prefer not to talk about it."
msgstr "이 청소 작업은 아주 힘들다. 그는 이것에 대하여 말하는 것을 원하지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant"
msgid "Wickerbottom is not opposed to self defense, should the occasion call for it."
msgstr "위커보텀은 필요하다면 자기 방어에 반대하지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_cook"
msgid "Wickerbottom has several cookbooks for just such an occasion."
msgstr "위커보텀은 이런 경우를 위해 여러 요리책을 가지고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formal"
msgid "Since Wickerbottom doesn't sleep, she can dance all night."
msgstr "위커보텀은 잠자지 않으니까 밤새도록 춤출 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "Wickerbottom adapted to life in the arena with grace and ease."
msgstr "위커보텀은 우아하고 쉽게 투기장에서의 삶에 적응했다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ice"
msgid "It would be wise not to get on the queen of winter's bad side."
msgstr "겨울 여왕을 기분 나쁘게 하지 않는 것이 현명하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat"
msgid "Ms. Voltbottom Costume"
msgstr "미즈 볼트버텀 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d"
msgid "An elegant costume for an elegant woman."
msgstr "우아한 여인을 위한 우아한 의상."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose"
msgid "Now duel for the rose queen's amusement."
msgstr "이제 장미 여왕의 즐거움을 위해 결투하라."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow"
msgid "A librarian knows how to watch from the shadows."
msgstr "사서는 그림자 안에서 주시하는 방법을 알고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor"
msgid "Those with knowledge are good at making do in difficult circumstances."
msgstr "지식이 있는 자는 까다로운 상황에 잘 적응한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_victorian"
msgid "How did Ms. Wickerbottom accrue her fortune? Perhaps you should mind your own business."
msgstr "위커보텀은 어떻게 재산을 축적했는가? 참견하지 않는 것이 신상에 좋다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant"
msgid "Willow was never one to be pushed around."
msgstr "윌로우는 우습게 볼 수 있는 존재가 아니었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_cook"
msgid "Chef Willow is a grease fire waiting to happen."
msgstr "윌로우는 불 붙기 쉬운 기름 같다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly"
msgid "Willowfly Costume"
msgstr "윌로우플라이 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d"
msgid "Willow would dress like this every day if she could."
msgstr "윌로우는 할 수만 있다면 매일 이렇게 입을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formal"
msgid "Willow prefers events that include bonfires or fireworks."
msgstr "윌로우는 모닥불 또는 폭죽 놀이가 있는 행사를 선호한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator"
msgid "Willow will reduce this ring to cinders."
msgstr "윌로우는 이 링을 불태워 버릴 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ice"
msgid "Coldfire is Willow's favorite type of fire... After hot fire, warm fire, tepid fire, and vaguely lukewarm fire."
msgstr "차가운 불은 윌로우가... 뜨거운 불, 따뜻한 불, 미지근한 불, 아주 미지근한 불 다음으로 좋아하는 불이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose"
msgid "Willow was always a bit prickly. Now she's just moreso."
msgstr "윌로우는 항상 약간의 까칠했다. 지금은 더하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow"
msgid "Willow enjoys flickering flames of inky blackness."
msgstr "윌로우는 먹물 같은 암흑의 피어오르는 화염을 즐긴다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor"
msgid "Willow is taming the wilderness with fire."
msgstr "윌로우가 불로 황무지를 길들이고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_victorian"
msgid "Willow doesn't just play with matches... she also peddles them."
msgstr "윌로우는 성냥을 가지고 놀고... 성냥을 판다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant"
msgid "This wouldn't be the first time Wilson's had to fight off a goon or two."
msgstr "윌슨이 싸우는 것은 이번이 처음이 아니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_cook"
msgid "Wilson's had a lot of experience cooking with found ingredients."
msgstr "윌슨은 발견한 재료로 요리한 경험이 많다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formal"
msgid "Formal Wilson is unhappy Wilson."
msgstr "정장 윌슨은 불행한 윌슨이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator"
msgid "Wilson is willing to take on any challenger."
msgstr "윌슨은 어떤 도전자라도 기꺼이 받아들인다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_ice"
msgid "The chill of the first frost of winter has beset poor Wilson."
msgstr "겨울의 첫 서리가 불쌍한 윌슨을 몰아친다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard"
msgid "Piggsbury Costume"
msgstr "픽스버리 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d"
msgid "Wilson usually forgets to put a costume together until the last moment. He's always busy experimenting."
msgstr "윌슨은 마지막 순간으로 의상을 입는 것을 미룬다. 언제나 실험하느라 바쁘다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose"
msgid "Who knew rose dye was so permanent?"
msgstr "장미 염료가 매우 영구적이라는 것을 누가 알았을까?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow"
msgid "Wilson has learned the science of shadows."
msgstr "윌슨은 그림자의 과학을 배웠다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor"
msgid "As a scientist, Wilson is well equipped to investigate the natural world."
msgstr "과학자인 윌슨은 자연 세계를 조사하기 위한 준비가 잘 되어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_victorian"
msgid "Wilson is a major advocate of the health benefits of leeches."
msgstr "윌슨은 거머리의 건강 혜택에 대한 열렬한 옹호자이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant"
msgid "Winona came ready for a fight!"
msgstr "위노나는 싸울 준비가 되었다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_cook"
msgid "Cooking is basically just food assembly, right?"
msgstr "요리는 식품을 조립하는 것 아닌가?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal"
msgid "This isn't what Winona expected when she read \"Formal Assembly\" on the invitation."
msgstr "위노나는 \"포멀 어셈블리\"로 이런 것을 예상하고 있지는 않았다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator"
msgid "Winona's tough as nails and ready to throw down."
msgstr "튼튼한 위노나는 이길 준비가 되었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko"
msgid "Nona Gekko Costume"
msgstr "노나 도마뱀붙이 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko_d"
msgid "It wasn't easy for Winona to get her hair like that."
msgstr "위노나가 머리를 그렇게 하는 것은 쉽지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_nature"
msgid "Winona's fingers are so callused, she barely even feels rose thorns."
msgstr "위노나의 손가락에는 너무 못이 단단히 나서, 그녀는 간신히 장미 가시를 느끼는 수준이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_rose"
msgid "By any other name, she'd smell of engine grease."
msgstr "원래 그녀에게서는 엔진 오일 냄새가 난다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_shadow"
msgid "No one knows the depths of Winona's dark machinations."
msgstr "아무도 위노나의 어두운 장치가 얼마나 심오한지 모른다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_survivor"
msgid "Winona's always been made of rough stuff."
msgstr "위노나는 항상 거칠었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_victorian"
msgid "Winona dreams up all sorts of fantastic mechanical inventions in her private workshop."
msgstr "위노나는 그녀의 개인 공방에서 온갖 신기한 기계 발명품을 만들어낸다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_black_davys
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_black_davys"
msgid "A dark winter hat for the dark winter months."
msgstr "어두운 겨울 기간을 위한 어두운 겨울 모자."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_fancy_puppy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_fancy_puppy"
msgid "Happiness is a warm puppy hat."
msgstr "행복은 따뜻한 강아지 모자다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_pink_hibiscus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_pink_hibiscus"
msgid "Doesn't keep your head any warmer than a regular winter hat, but gosh if it isn't just the cutest."
msgstr "보통 겨울 모자보다 머리를 더 따뜻하게 하지는 않으나 가장 귀여우면 모자일지도 모른다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_plum_pudding
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_plum_pudding"
msgid "This plum pudding hat contains no plums. Just a bunch of raisins."
msgstr "이 자두 모자에는 자두가 들어 있지 않다. 건포도가 잔뜩 들어있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_rooster
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_rooster"
msgid "This winter hat is strangely reminiscent of a small feathered friend."
msgstr "이 겨울 모자는 작은 깃털을 가진 친구를 이상하게 연상케 합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_stocking_cap_green_forest
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winterhat_stocking_cap_green_forest"
msgid "One might wear this 'forest guardian green' winter hat on a cozy night around a campfire. Or, hey, they might not."
msgstr "모닥불 주변의 아늑한 밤에 '숲의 보호자 녹색' 모자를 착용 할 수도 있다. 또는 그렇지 않을지도 모른다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_combatant"
msgid "Wolfgang's no stranger to the art of pugilism."
msgstr "볼프강은 권투 기술에 익숙하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_cook"
msgid "Wolfgang can't relax unless all his friends are well fed."
msgstr "볼프강은 친구들이 다 잘 먹기 전에는 쉴 수 없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_formal"
msgid "Wolfgang enjoys formal dinners: the food is usually excellent."
msgstr "볼프강은 정식 만찬을 즐긴다. 요리는 대체로 훌륭하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_gladiator"
msgid "This look suits Wolfgang, and he knows it."
msgstr "볼프강에 어울리는 모습이다. 그 자신도 이것을 잘 알고 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_ice"
msgid "Wolfgang enjoys passing cold winter nights around a fire with loved ones."
msgstr "볼프강은 친구들과 함께 불을 피워 추운 겨울 밤을 보내는 것을 즐긴다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_rose"
msgid "This moustache doesn't tickle, it prickles."
msgstr "이 콧수염은 간지러운 게 아니라 따끔하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_shadow"
msgid "Wolfgang is even mightier than usual."
msgstr "볼프강이 평소보다 더 힘세다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_survivor"
msgid "In the wilderness, only the mighty survive."
msgstr "황무지에서는 힘센 자만이 생존한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_victorian"
msgid "Pugilism is a gentleman's sport."
msgstr "권투는 신사의 스포츠이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus"
msgid "MacWolf Costume"
msgstr "맥울프 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang_walrus_d"
msgid "It seems a shame to hide such luxurious hair."
msgstr "이런 고급스러운 털을 감추는 것은 아깝다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_combatant"
msgid "It's best not to mess with a man and his axe."
msgstr "남자와 그의 도끼는 성가시게 하지 않는 것이 좋다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_cook"
msgid "Woodie's not beyond using an axe in the kitchen."
msgstr "우디는 부엌에서도 도끼를 쓴다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_formal"
msgid "Woodie puts bear fat in his hair when he goes out."
msgstr "우디는 나들이 갈 때 머리에 곰기름을 바른다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_gladiator"
msgid "Woodie is a wild man in the arena."
msgstr "우디는 투기장의 야인이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_nature"
msgid "All Woodie needs is the sun, the rain, and his favourite tree seeds."
msgstr "우디가 원하는 것은 태양, 비, 그리고 그가 좋아하는 나무 씨뿐이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_rose"
msgid "Woodie tends his own garden more often than he tends his own hair."
msgstr "우디는 자신의 모발보다 정원을 더 자주 손질한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_shadow"
msgid "The shadow realm is pretty much the same as here, just darker."
msgstr "그림자의 영역은 여기와 비슷하지만 더 어두울 뿐이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_survivor"
msgid "Woodie looks like he's turning into a tree."
msgstr "우디가 나무로 변하는 것으로 보인다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard"
msgid "Woodguard Costume"
msgstr "우드가드 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_treeguard_d"
msgid "Woodie will have twigs stuck in his beard for weeks. Not that that's unusual."
msgstr "우디의 수염에는 몇 주 동안 가지가 꽂혀 있다. 그에겐 이것이 정상이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_victorian"
msgid "Woodie's wilderness survival comes in handy in the great North."
msgstr "우디의 야생 생존 능력은 북방의 야생 지역에서 유용하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_combatant"
msgid "Few things get them more excited than the prospect of destroying fleshlings."
msgstr "고깃덩이들을 파괴하는 것을 가장 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_cook"
msgid "WX must have some utensil addons somewhere around here."
msgstr "WX는 아마 식기 애드온을 가지고 있을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_formal"
msgid "ERROR: DO NOT RECOGNIZE COMMAND \"MOUSTACHE.TWIRL\""
msgstr "오류: \"콧수염.비비꼬기\" 명령을 인식할 수 없음"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_gladiator"
msgid "WX's transformation into an organic killing machine proves all dreams are possible, if you only believe."
msgstr "유기 살인 기계로의 WX의 변신은 신념만 있다면 모든 꿈이 가능하다는 것을 증명한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_nature"
msgid "WX-78 has become a solar powered robot."
msgstr "WX-78은 태양열 구동 로봇이 되었다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rhinorook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rhinorook"
msgid "Rookiebot Costume"
msgstr "루키봇 의상"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rhinorook_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rhinorook_d"
msgid "The welding on this costume took AGES."
msgstr "이 의상을 용접하는 데 오래 걸렸다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_rose"
msgid "The organics have inextricably grown on WX... Regrettable."
msgstr "유기물이 WX에 생장하게 되었다... 유감스럽게도."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_shadow"
msgid "This robot was evil before. Now they're double evil."
msgstr "이 로봇은 사악했었다. 이제 두 배로 사악하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_survivor"
msgid "Exposure to the elements causes corrosion."
msgstr "날씨가 부식하게 만든다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78_victorian"
msgid "These are their diving gears."
msgstr "이것이 그들의 잠수 도구이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.amulet_red_heart
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.amulet_red_heart"
msgid "Clement Life Amulet"
msgstr "관대한 생명의 부적"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.amulet_red_occulteye
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.amulet_red_occulteye"
msgid "Clairvoyant Life Amulet"
msgstr "천리안 생명의 부적"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.armor_dragonfly_fangedcollar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.armor_dragonfly_fangedcollar"
msgid "Jagged Dragonfly Armor"
msgstr "들쭉날쭉한 용파리 갑옷"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.armor_dragonfly_haramaki
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_NAMES.armor_dragonfly_haramaki"
